; An account directive whose sub-directives end an included file still
; records where it ends, so an assertion it raises quotes it in the error
; context.  The included file ends right after the `assert` line, with no
; blank line, so the directive body stops at end of file.

include account-assert-at-eof.dat

2024/01/01 Payee
    Assets:Cash                  $-10.00
    Expenses:Food

test reg -> 1
__ERROR__
While parsing file "$FILE", line 10:
While applying automated transaction from "$sourcepath/test/regress/account-assert-at-eof.dat", lines 1-2:
> account Assets:Cash
>     assert amount > 0
While extending transaction from "$FILE", lines 8-10:
> 2024/01/01 Payee
>     Assets:Cash                  $-10.00
>     Expenses:Food
Error: Transaction assertion failed: (amount > {0})
end test
